  "title": "Introducing Ray-Ban Meta Audio and More AI Glasses Styles",
  "link": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/introducing-ray-ban-meta-audio-glasses-new-styles-plus-muse/",
  "pub_date": "Wed, 23 Sep 2026 11:36:25 +0000",
  "author": "Facebook",
  "content_snippet": "Today at Connect, we introduced Ray-Ban Meta Audio, our first-ever audio glasses, and our biggest expansion of AI glasses.\nThe post Introducing Ray-Ban Meta Audio and More AI Glasses Styles appeared first on Meta Newsroom.",
  "content_full": "<div><img width=\"890\" height=\"501\" src=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Introducing-Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio-and-More-AI-Glasses-Styles_Thumbnail.jpg?fit=890%2C501\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\" srcset=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Introducing-Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio-and-More-AI-Glasses-Styles_Thumbnail.jpg?w=1920 1920w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Introducing-Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio-and-More-AI-Glasses-Styles_Thumbnail.jpg?w=300 300w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Introducing-Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio-and-More-AI-Glasses-Styles_Thumbnail.jpg?w=768 768w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Introducing-Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio-and-More-AI-Glasses-Styles_Thumbnail.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Introducing-Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio-and-More-AI-Glasses-Styles_Thumbnail.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Introducing-Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio-and-More-AI-Glasses-Styles_Thumbnail.jpg?w=800 800w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Introducing-Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio-and-More-AI-Glasses-Styles_Thumbnail.jpg?w=1780 1780w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 890px) 100vw, 890px\" /></div><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Today at Connect, we announced Ray-Ban Meta Audio, our first-ever audio glasses, and our biggest expansion of AI glasses yet through our partnership with EssilorLuxottica. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">We&#8217;re building AI glasses for everyone. By the end of the year, we&#8217;ll offer more than 100 different glasses options across Ray-Ban, Oakley, and Meta Glasses, including lightweight frames made for all-day wear and new styles with slimmer designs and longer battery life. And with regular software updates, new AI features, and our growing ecosystem of apps and experiences, these glasses will only keep getting better.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">AI glasses help you on the go, from giving you sports scores and local restaurant picks to translating live conversations. With a connection to your </span><a href=\"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/introducing-muse-personal-ai-agent/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">personal AI agent from Muse</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">, they’ll offer more ways than ever to help you manage your daily life — whether you&#8217;re building healthy habits or navigating a busy calendar — all without reaching for your phone.</span></p>\n<h2>Ray-Ban Meta Audio</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Audio has been our most popular feature since day one because our glasses give you high-quality sound without closing you off from the world around you. Our new Ray-Ban Meta Audio glasses pack the power of earbuds and AI into our lightest and slimmest AI glasses yet, in iconic Ray-Ban style. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">At just 43 grams, Ray-Ban Meta Audio glasses are light enough to wear all day, and offer maximum comfort with professional-adjustable temple tips, adjustable or swappable nose pads, and overextension hinges. You can listen to music and podcasts, take calls that capture your voice more clearly than earbuds, and talk with your AI assistant hands-free for up to 12 hours on a single charge, with up to an additional 48 hours from the included charging case. </span></p>\n<div style=\"width: 960px;\" class=\"wp-video\"><video class=\"wp-video-shortcode\" id=\"video-50267-5\" width=\"960\" height=\"836\" poster=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/01_expansion_inline_audio_cover.jpg\" preload=\"metadata\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/01_expansion_inline_audio.mp4?_=5\" /><a href=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/01_expansion_inline_audio.mp4\">https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/01_expansion_inline_audio.mp4</a></video></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">They come in 23 color and lens combinations across two new styles: Clubmaster, an iconic Ray-Ban style with a retro-inspired silhouette, and Burbank, a classic, timeless rectangle style. Both are compatible with a wide range of optical prescriptions.</span></p>\n\n    <div\n        id=\"gallery-50271,50272,50273,50274,50275-1-slideshow\" \n        class=\"jetpack-slideshow-window jetpack-slideshow jetpack-slideshow-black\" \n        data-trans=\"fade\" \n        data-autostart=\"true\" \n        data-gallery=\"[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/02_Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio_Carousel_01.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50271&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;02_Ray Ban Meta Audio_Carousel_01&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RBM Audio Clubmaster Shiny Black on Gold Transitions Graphite Green Lenses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/02_Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio_Carousel_02.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50272&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;02_Ray Ban Meta Audio_Carousel_02&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RBM Audio Clubmaster Transparent Orchid on Gun Metal Transitions Ruby Lenses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/02_Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio_Carousel_03.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50273&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;02_Ray Ban Meta Audio_Carousel_03&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RBM Audio Clubmaster Shiny Black Clear Lenses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/02_Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio_Carousel_04.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50274&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;02_Ray Ban Meta Audio_Carousel_04&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RBM Audio Burbank Matte Black Transitions Graphite Green Lenses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/02_Ray-Ban-Meta-Audio_Carousel_05.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50275&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;02_Ray Ban Meta Audio_Carousel_05&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RBM Audio Burbank Shiny Black Transitions Grey Lenses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;}]\" \n        itemscope \n        itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageGallery\">\n    </div>\n\n    \n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can pre-order a pair today starting at $349 USD and they ship October 13.</span></p>\n<h2>Ray-Ban Meta (Gen 3)</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Ray-Ban Meta (Gen 3) is the next generation of the world’s best-selling AI glasses. In support of our vision to make great-looking glasses first, we’ve packed the tech Ray-Ban Meta wearers love into a slimmer, more comfortable design, with longer battery life and a new customizable action button for instant access to Meta AI. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">With Ray-Ban Meta (Gen 3), we&#8217;re giving people more choice than ever. They come in 27 color and lens combinations across 3 styles: Aviator, Zena (a bold new cat-eye frame), and Wayfarer. And to mark the 90th anniversary of the Ray-Ban Aviator, we&#8217;re releasing a limited-edition Aviator in a vintage-inspired colorway. </span></p>\n\n    <div\n        id=\"gallery-50276,50277,50278,50279-2-slideshow\" \n        class=\"jetpack-slideshow-window jetpack-slideshow jetpack-slideshow-black\" \n        data-trans=\"fade\" \n        data-autostart=\"true\" \n        data-gallery=\"[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/03_Ray-Ban-Meta-Gen3_Carousel_01.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50276&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;03_Ray Ban Meta Gen3_Carousel_01&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RBM (Gen 3) Limited Edition Aviator Milky Warm Beige Transitions Brown Lenses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/03_Ray-Ban-Meta-Gen3_Carousel_02.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50277&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;03_Ray Ban Meta Gen3_Carousel_02&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RBM (Gen 3) Wayfarer Havana Green Lenses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/03_Ray-Ban-Meta-Gen3_Carousel_03.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50278&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;03_Ray Ban Meta Gen3_Carousel_03&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RBM (Gen 3) Zena Shiny Black Clear Lenses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/03_Ray-Ban-Meta-Gen3_Carousel_04.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50279&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;03_Ray Ban Meta Gen3_Carousel_04&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RBM (Gen 3) Zena Mily Grey Lilac Transitions Copper Lenses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;}]\" \n        itemscope \n        itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageGallery\">\n    </div>\n\n    \n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Gen 3 gets up to nine hours of battery life (an hour more than Gen 2) plus professional-adjustable temple tips for a better fit. A new 6-mic array cuts more than 90% of background noise, so calls and voice commands are crisp and clear, even on windy or crowded streets. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">With a 12 MP camera and 3K Ultra HD video recording, you can capture photos and videos hands-free to save and share with others, and with new dynamic photos, you get to choose the best frame, so you get a standout picture every time. As with every generation of the glasses, these feature a built-in LED light that helps make people around you aware if you’re taking photos or video.</span></p>\n<div style=\"width: 960px;\" class=\"wp-video\"><video class=\"wp-video-shortcode\" id=\"video-50267-6\" width=\"960\" height=\"836\" poster=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/04_inline_aviator_cover.jpg\" preload=\"metadata\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/04_inline_aviator.mp4?_=6\" /><a href=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/04_inline_aviator.mp4\">https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/04_inline_aviator.mp4</a></video></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Later this year, Meta AI glasses will be the first consumer devices that enable users to capture and experience videos in Dolby Atmos with 360-degree spatial sound. Just record and your glasses handle everything, so playback feels as immersive as being there.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Ray-Ban Meta (Gen 3) is available today, with prices starting at $449 USD.</span></p>\n<h2>Even More From Meta Glasses</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Earlier this year, we launched </span><a href=\"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/06/meta-essilorluxottica-partner-launch-meta-glasses/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Meta Glasses</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> in partnership with EssilorLuxottica. We’re now expanding the collection with two new styles, Capri and Nova; giving you more ways to personalize; and bringing them to new markets around the world.</span></p>\n<h3>A Fresh Take on Meta Glasses by Kylie Jenner</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Building on the success of </span><a href=\"https://www.meta.com/ai-glasses/meta-glasses/kylie-jenner/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Meta Glasses by Kylie Jenner</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">, we&#8217;re releasing a new colorway, Ivory, that’s a fresh take on her signature Starfire style. Starting at $399 USD.</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_KYLIE.jpg\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-50281\" src=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_KYLIE.jpg?resize=960%2C836\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"836\" srcset=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_KYLIE.jpg?w=1920 1920w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_KYLIE.jpg?w=300 300w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_KYLIE.jpg?w=768 768w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_KYLIE.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_KYLIE.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_KYLIE.jpg?w=1240 1240w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_KYLIE.jpg?w=689 689w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></a></p>\n<h3>A New Collab With LISA</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">We&#8217;re also introducing an all new Meta Glasses collection designed with international icon, LISA. Every detail brings you closer to her world, from the custom star adorning the case and frames, to special edition case charms inspired by LISA&#8217;s pets, and unique digital photocards you unlock with the glasses.</span></p>\n\t<section id=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel-1\" class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel\" style=\"--fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel-ratio: 1920 / 1672;\" data-fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel data-frame-ratio=\"1920 / 1672\">\n\t\t<div class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__viewport\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__slides\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__slide is-active is-width-constrained\" style=\"--fbcorp-mixed-media-item-ratio: 1920 / 1672;\" data-fbcorp-mixed-media-slide data-media-type=\"image\" data-is-gif=\"false\" data-ratio=\"1920/1672\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__frame pmz-img-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" width=\"960\" height=\"836\" src=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_LISA.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&#038;resize=960%2C836\" class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__media\" alt=\"LISA wearing Meta glasses\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-is-gif=\"false\" data-gif-src=\"\" data-static-ms=\"3000\" srcset=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_LISA.jpg?w=1920 1920w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_LISA.jpg?w=300 300w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_LISA.jpg?w=768 768w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_LISA.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_LISA.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_LISA.jpg?w=1240 1240w, https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_LISA.jpg?w=689 689w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"pmz-img-download fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__download\" data-attachment-id=\"50283\" data-mixed-media-icon=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/plugins/post-media-zip/assets/downloadicon_arrowimg.png\" data-mixed-media-icon-light=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/plugins/post-media-zip/assets/downloadicon_arrow.png\" aria-label=\"Download image\" data-tooltip=\"Download image\">\n\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/plugins/post-media-zip/assets/downloadicon_arrowimg.png?resize=18%2C18\" alt=\"\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-mixed-media-icon-theme=\"dark\">\n\t\t<span class=\"pmz-sr-only\">Download image</span>\n\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__slide is-width-constrained\" style=\"--fbcorp-mixed-media-item-ratio: 1920 / 1672;\" data-fbcorp-mixed-media-slide data-media-type=\"video\" data-is-gif=\"false\" data-ratio=\"1920/1672\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__frame pmz-img-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<video class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__media\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline webkit-playsinline controlslist=\"nodownload noplaybackrate\" disablepictureinpicture data-fbcorp-mixed-media-video>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<source src=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/06_inline_lisaCharms.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</video>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"pmz-img-download fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__download\" data-attachment-id=\"50282\" data-mixed-media-icon=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/plugins/post-media-zip/assets/downloadicon_arrowimg.png\" data-mixed-media-icon-light=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/plugins/post-media-zip/assets/downloadicon_arrow.png\" aria-label=\"Download video\" data-tooltip=\"Download video\">\n\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/plugins/post-media-zip/assets/downloadicon_arrowimg.png?resize=18%2C18\" alt=\"\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-mixed-media-icon-theme=\"dark\">\n\t\t<span class=\"pmz-sr-only\">Download video</span>\n\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__arrow fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__arrow--prev\" data-fbcorp-mixed-media-prev aria-label=\"Previous slide\"></button>\n\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__arrow fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__arrow--next\" data-fbcorp-mixed-media-next aria-label=\"Next slide\"></button>\n\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"fbcorp-mixed-media-carousel__toggle is-running\" data-fbcorp-mixed-media-toggle aria-label=\"Pause carousel\"></button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\t\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The collection features two distinct styles: the Meta Adventurer LISA Edition, a Moonlit Sky frame with Blush lenses, and the Meta Capri LISA Edition, an Eclipse cat-eye frame with grey lenses. Both styles support prescriptions and start at $399 USD.  </span></p>\n<h3>Our Most Affordable Glasses Yet</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">We’re also introducing new limited-edition frames, our most affordable pair of Meta Glasses yet, and new ways to personalize your AI glasses.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The limited-edition Meta Fury features a clear frame and mirrored lenses and will be available exclusively at Connect and Meta Labs at launch. We&#8217;re also launching a new Meta Adventurer, featuring a black frame and grey lenses, with a plug-in case starting at $249 USD, our most accessible price yet. It’s available for pre-order today on Meta.com and on sale October 23 in all countries where Meta Glasses are sold.</span></p>\n\n    <div\n        id=\"gallery-50284,50285,50286,50287-3-slideshow\" \n        class=\"jetpack-slideshow-window jetpack-slideshow jetpack-slideshow-black\" \n        data-trans=\"fade\" \n        data-autostart=\"true\" \n        data-gallery=\"[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/08_Meta-Glasses_Carousel_01.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50284&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;08_Meta Glasses_Carousel_01&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Meta Glasses Rectangle Lisa Edition Moonlit Sky Blush&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/08_Meta-Glasses_Carousel_02.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50285&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;08_Meta Glasses_Carousel_02&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Picture of Meta Glasses in Cateye Classic Black - Clear to Grey Transitions&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/08_Meta-Glasses_Carousel_03.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50286&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;08_Meta Glasses_Carousel_03&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Image of Meta Glasses in Panthos Small Sandstone Chocolate&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/about.fb.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/08_Meta-Glasses_Carousel_04.jpg?fit=1920%2C1672&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;50287&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;08_Meta Glasses_Carousel_04&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Image of Meta Glasses in Slim Oval Kylie Edition Ivory Black&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;itemprop&quot;:&quot;image&quot;}]\" \n        itemscope \n        itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageGallery\">\n    </div>\n\n    \n<h3>More Styles for More People</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Any pair of Meta Glasses can also now be customized through our Mix &amp; Match program, where you can customize your Meta Glasses at a Meta Lab store or online by choosing your favorite frame, lenses, and case color.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">We want everyone to be able to enjoy Meta Glasses, so we’re bringing them to new countries  around the world* — starting today in Singapore, South Korea, and Mexico, and the United Arab Emirates, and coming soon to Brazil.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">* </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Oakley Meta, Ray-Ban Meta and Ray-Ban Meta Optics will be available in these new markets later this year: Turkey, Poland, Portugal, Israel, South Africa, Indonesia, Thailand, Hong Kong, New Zealand, Malaysia, and the Philippines.</span></i></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/introducing-ray-ban-meta-audio-glasses-new-styles-plus-muse/\">Introducing Ray-Ban Meta Audio and More AI Glasses Styles</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://about.fb.com\">Meta Newsroom</a>.</p>\n",
